  (descr "Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. An alternative to \"SW_Kailh_Choc_V1_THT\" with additional fix pin. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.4=13.80mm square (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u (courtyard 38.05x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. For Kailh Choc 1350 stabilizers use the _ChocStab variant.")
